LUMA SUMMARY:
QS 5.10 introduces lazy Kokoro loading plus selectable Kokoro voices. GPT is assigned the Aisha voice, the handshake eventually succeeds through an Enter/DOM path with new-output evidence, and the first Kokoro activation loads the engine in the background. This marks the transition toward practical per-node voice selection without paying the full Kokoro startup cost at QS launch.</summary>
